:: MMA Gym
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "mma_gym">><<effects>><<npc Riley>><<person1>>
<<if $mmagymintro is undefined or $mmagymintro is null>><<set $mmagymintro to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mmaGymAccessAsked is undefined>><<set $mmaGymAccessAsked to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mmaGymAccessUnlocked is undefined>><<set $mmaGymAccessUnlocked to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mmaGymSparUnlocked is undefined>><<set $mmaGymSparUnlocked to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mmaConditioningUnlocked is undefined>><<set $mmaConditioningUnlocked to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mmaWeightsSessions is undefined>><<set $mmaWeightsSessions to 0>><</if>>
<<set _openinghours to 0>><<if Time.hour gte 8 and Time.hour lt 21>><<set _openinghours to 1>><</if>>

<<if $mmagymintro isnot 1 and _openinghours is 1>>
	<<mmaGymIntro "MMA Gym">>
<<elseif _openinghours is 0>>
	The building is dark outside opening hours. Without the music and shouting, the place feels bigger. But you spot a standard cash register sits on a counter. It's locked tight.
	<br><br><<set $lock to 200>>
	<<if currentSkillValue('skulduggery') gte $lock>>
		<<if $leftarm is "bound" and $rightarm is "bound">>
			You think you'd be able to pick the lock, <span class="blue">if your arms weren't bound.</span>
			<br><br>
		<<else>>
			<<wearProp "lockpick">>
			<span class="green">The lock looks easy to pick.</span>
			<br><br>
			<<lockicon "pick">><<link [[Pick it (0:10)|MMA Gym Register Sneak]]>><<handheldon>><<pass 10>><<crimeUp 10 "thievery">><</link>><<crime "thievery">>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<span class="red">The lock looks beyond your ability to pick.</span><<skulduggeryrequired>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
	<<nightingaleicon>><<link [[Leave|Nightingale Street]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	The MMA gym smells of sweat, disinfectant, and old rubber. Heavy bags sway along one wall, a cramped weights area sits beyond a rack of battered plates, and a square of mats at the back serves as Riley's class space. Nothing in here is polished for show.
	<br><br>
	<<if $stress gte $stressmax>>
		<<passoutshop>>
	<<else>>
		<<if $pleasure gte $pleasuremax>>
			<<orgasmLocation "mmaGym">>
		<</if>>
		<<if _openinghours is 1>>
			<<lockericon>><<link [[Changing room|MMA Gym Changing Room]]>><</link>>
			<br><br>
		<</if>>
		<<if Time.hour is 21>>
			It is closing time. Riley starts shooing everyone toward the door.<<if $exposed gte 1>> Your stomach drops as you remember what state of dress you are in.<</if>>
			<br>
		<<elseif $exposed gte 1>>
			<span class="blue">You're too exposed to use anything or interact with anyone.</span>
			<<covered>><br>
		<<elseif $leftarm is "bound" or $rightarm is "bound">>
			<span class="blue">You can't make proper use of the gym room with your hands bound.</span>
			<br>
		<<elseif _openinghours is 1 and $exposed lt 1>>
			<<icon "physique.png">><<link [[Use the weights room (0:30)|MMA Weights Room]]>><<set $phase to 0>><<pass 30>><</link>><<gphysique>><<gathletics>><<note " Moderate fatigue" "red">>
			<br>
			<<if $mmaGymAccessUnlocked isnot 1>>
				<<if $mmaGymAccessAsked isnot 1>>
					<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Ask Riley about using the rest of the gym|MMA Gym Access Request]]>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>
					<br>
				<<else>>
					<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Ask Riley for another assessment (0:30)|MMA Riley Challenge Start]]>><<set $mmaRileyChallengeMode to "unlock">><<set $phase to 0>><<pass 30>><</link>>
					<br>
				<</if>>
			<<else>>
				<<if $combatExtended.standingFights is 1 and $combatExtended.footworkToggle is 1>>
					<<if $money gte 12000>>
						<<mmagymicon>><<link [[Take a footwork lesson (£120 1:00)|Footwork Lesson]]>><<set $phase to 0>><<set $gymstage to 0>><<money -12000 "mmaGymLessons">><</link>><<gfootwork>><<note " Heavy fatigue risk" "red">>
						<br>
					<<else>>
						<span class="blue">You can't afford a footwork lesson.</span>
						<br>
					<</if>>
				<</if>>
				<<if $combatExtended.strikingToggle is 1>>
					<<if $money gte 18000>>
						<<mmagymicon>><<link [[Take a striking lesson (£180 1:00)|Striking Lesson]]>><<set $phase to 0>><<set $gymstage to 0>><<money -18000 "mmaGymLessons">><</link>><<note "+ Striking" "green">><<note " Heavy fatigue risk" "red">>
						<br>
					<<else>>
						<span class="blue">You can't afford a striking lesson.</span>
						<br>
					<</if>>
				<</if>>
				<<if $combatExtended.kickingToggle is 1>>
					<<if $money gte 18000>>
						<<mmagymicon>><<link [[Take a kicking lesson (£180 1:00)|Kicking Lesson]]>><<set $phase to 0>><<set $gymstage to 0>><<money -18000 "mmaGymLessons">><</link>><<note "+ Kicking" "green">><<note " Heavy fatigue risk" "red">>
						<br>
					<<else>>
						<span class="blue">You can't afford a kicking lesson.</span>
						<br>
					<</if>>
				<</if>>
				<<if $mmaConditioningUnlocked is 1>>
					<<if $money gte 10000>>
						<<mmagymicon>><<link [[Take a conditioning lesson (£100 1:00)|Conditioning Lesson 1]]>><<set $phase to 0>><<money -10000 "mmaGymLessons">><</link>><<gphysique>><<gathletics>><<gwillpower>><<note " Brutal fatigue" "red">>
						<br>
					<<else>>
						<span class="blue">You can't afford a conditioning lesson.</span>
						<br>
					<</if>>
				<<else>>
					<span class="blue">Riley hasn't opened conditioning work to you yet.</span>
					<br>
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
			<<socialiseicon>><<link [[Spar with the regulars (0:45)|MMA Regular Sparring]]>><</link>><<gathletics>><<note " Moderate fatigue" "red">>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<<if $mmaGymSparUnlocked is 1 and $exposed lt 1>>
			<<socialiseicon>><<link [[Spar with Riley (0:30)|MMA Riley Challenge Start]]>><<set $mmaRileyChallengeMode to "spar">><<set $phase to 0>><<pass 30>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<<storeon "mma_gym" "check">>
		<<if _store_check is 1 and ($worn.upper.name is "naked" or $worn.lower.name is "naked") and $exposed is 1>>
			You left clothes in the changing room. Your <span class="lewd"><<lewdness>></span> is fine in here, but it would be considered lewd outside.
			<br><br>
			<<if $exhibitionism gte 15>>
				<<nightingaleicon>><<link [[Go outside anyway|MMA Gym Outside Exhibitionism]]>><</link>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
			<<link [[Return to the changing room|MMA Gym Changing Room]]>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			<br>
			<<nightingaleicon>><<link [[Leave|Nightingale Street]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

:: MMA Gym Introduction
<<effects>>
<<if $phase is 1>>
	You hover at the edge of the floor. "Uh... hello."
	<br><br>
	Riley gives you one look. "Speak up. This isn't a library." <<He>> jerks <<his>> chin toward the others. "You want to train, get on the floor. You want to stand there looking lost, use the door instead."
	<br><br>
	Heat climbs up your neck. You hurry into line before <<he>> can dismiss you outright.
<<elseif $phase is 2>>
	You meet Riley's stare. "I'm ready."
	<br><br>
	"Good," Riley says. "Stay that confident when your legs start shaking." <<He>> points you toward the marked space. "Listen the first time and you'll waste less of mine."
	<br><br>
	You take your place while Riley starts the warm-up.
<<elseif $phase is 3>>
	<<promiscuity1>>You let your gaze linger. "You greet all new students like that?"
	<br><br>
	Riley's mouth twitches. "Only the ones who mistake this place for flirting practice." <<He>> brushes past you. "Eyes forward. Hands up."
	<br><br>
	So much for that. The class moves, and you move with it.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|$mmaGymIntroExit]]>><<unset $mmaGymIntroExit>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MMA Weights Room
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "mma_gym">><<effects>><<speechresolve>>
<<if $mmaWeightsSessions is undefined>><<set $mmaWeightsSessions to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mmaGymAccessUnlocked is undefined>><<set $mmaGymAccessUnlocked to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mmaConditioningUnlocked is undefined>><<set $mmaConditioningUnlocked to 0>><</if>>
<<if currentSkillValue('physique') lt 1000>>
	<<set _failChance to 47>>
<<elseif currentSkillValue('physique') lt 2500>>
	<<set _failChance to 37>>
<<elseif currentSkillValue('physique') lt 5000>>
	<<set _failChance to 27>>
<<elseif currentSkillValue('physique') lt 8000>>
	<<set _failChance to 17>>
<<else>>
	<<set _failChance to 7>>
<</if>>
<<if ($willpower gte 500 or $athletics gte 700) and _failChance gt 7>><<set _failChance to 7>><</if>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	<<set _weightsThought to "You force the bar back up. Stronger means harder to corner, harder to scare, harder to push around when someone decides you look easy.">>
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	<<set _weightsThought to "You follow the count Riley sets and make yourself finish each lift properly. It is easier to obey the rhythm than admit how much you need this strength.">>
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	<<set _weightsThought to "You keep your breathing neat and your form cleaner than your shaking muscles want it to be. If Riley is going to correct you, you would rather make Riley work for the excuse.">>
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	<<set _weightsThought to "The work is simple enough to trust: lift, breathe, recover, and prove you belong here without needing to say it out loud.">>
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	<<set _weightsThought to "The thought flashes between sets: beat Riley, shut the smug idiots up, stop letting anyone in town look down on you.">>
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	<<set _weightsThought to "The burn gives you something useful to aim at. Riley, the regulars, anyone who ever mistook you for easy aim. Let them laugh now, while they still can.">>
<<else>>
	<<set _weightsThought to "You tell yourself the work is practical. More access, better training, more to gain from this place than a session with the weights.">>
<</if>>
<<wearProp "weight">>
The weights room is cramped and noisy, all clashing plates and sharp corrections. Riley keeps you moving between rack, bench, and sled without leaving much time to recover.
<<print _weightsThought>>
<br><br>
<<if random(1,100) lte _failChance>>
	Your form goes before you're half done. Riley stops you cold and makes you start over.
	<br><br>
	"Again," Riley says. "If you get sloppy under a bar, you get hurt. Learn that now."
	<<physique 1>><<gphysique>><<athletics 1>><<gathletics>><<pain 2>><<gpain>><<tiredness 6>><<ggtiredness>><<stress 3>><<gstress>>
<<elseif currentSkillValue('physique') gte 8000>>
	You finish sore, breathing hard, and steady enough that Riley only needs to correct you once.
	<<physique 2>><<gphysique>><<athletics 1>><<gathletics>><<tiredness 3>><<gtiredness>><<stress 2>><<gstress>>
<<elseif currentSkillValue('physique') gte 5000>>
	By the end your limbs feel heavy and your shirt sticks to your back, but you keep your form together and get through the full session cleanly.
	<<physique 2>><<gphysique>><<athletics 1>><<gathletics>><<tiredness 6>><<ggtiredness>><<stress 3>><<gstress>>
<<else>>
	It is ugly work. Your muscles burn, your breathing turns ragged, and Riley has to keep dragging you back into proper position before you hurt yourself.
	<<physique 1>><<gphysique>><<athletics 1>><<gathletics>><<tiredness 7>><<ggtiredness>><<stress 4>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<<set $mmaWeightsSessions += 1>><<if $mmaWeightsSessions gt 5>><<set $mmaWeightsSessions to 5>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<if $mmaGymAccessUnlocked isnot 1 and $mmaWeightsSessions gte 2>>
	You catch Riley at the end of your set, arms folded. No praise. But no dismissal either.
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<if $mmaGymAccessUnlocked is 1 and $mmaConditioningUnlocked isnot 1 and $mmaWeightsSessions gte 5 and currentSkillValue('physique') gte 5000>>
	<<set $mmaConditioningUnlocked to 1>>
	Riley stops you before you leave. "You are finally strong enough that I can start ruining your willpower properly too. Conditioning. Different kind of ugly. Interested?"<<npcincr Riley love 1>><<glove>>
	<br>
	<span class="green"><i>The conditioning lesson unlocked!</i></span>
	<br><br>
<</if>>
Riley glances at the clock. "Enough. Wipe the bench down when you're done."
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|MMA Gym]]>><<endevent>><<handheldon>><</link>>

:: MMA Gym Access Request
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "mma_gym">><<effects>><<set $mmaGymAccessAsked to 1>>
<<if $leftarm is "bound" or $rightarm is "bound">>
	You glance past the weights room towards the hanging bags and the mat space beyond. "Can I use the rest of the gym too?"
	<br><br>
	Riley follows your look, then drops <<his>> eyes to your bound hands. Whatever answer you were hoping for dies there.
	"Not like that."
	<br><br>
	Before you can argue, <<he>> steps in close, catches your wrists, and turns them just enough to inspect the binding properly. <<His>> fingers are rough but steady as <<he>> tests the knot, then reaches for a small blade kept nearby with the gym supplies.
	<br><br>
	"You want to train in my gym, you use your hands properly."
	<br><br>
	The edge slips beneath the binding and parts it. The pressure falls away at once, leaving your skin tingling as blood rushes back into your hands. Riley tosses the cut length aside and gives your wrists one last look before releasing you.
	<br><br>
	"There." <<He>> jerks <<his>> chin towards the equipment. "Now ask again."
	<br><br><<unbind>>
	<<link [[Next|MMA Gym Access Request]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	You look past the weights room toward the bags and mats. "Can I use the rest of the gym too?"
	<br><br>
	A couple of regulars laugh before Riley can answer. "That one?" someone says. "Give it a week."
	<br><br>
	Riley cuts across them with a stare sharp enough to silence the whole corner. "<<pShe>> asked me, not you."
	Then <<he>> looks you over. "More floor space means more chances to hurt yourself. <span class="red">So earn it</span>. Beat me in an assessment round and you can use the rest."
	<br><br>
	The laughter does not start up again.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Take the assessment now (0:30)|MMA Riley Challenge Start]]>><<set $mmaRileyChallengeMode to "unlock">><<pass 30>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Back off for now|MMA Gym]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MMA Riley Challenge Choice Result
<<if $mmaRileyLastAction>>
	<<print $mmaRileyLastAction>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $mmaRileyLastScore gte 3>>
		For a moment, it actually works. Riley's posture shifts and a few people at ringside stop looking bored.
		<<physique 1>><<athletics 1>><<ggphysique>><<gathletics>>
	<<elseif $mmaRileyLastScore gte 1>>
		It is not wrong, just not enough. You stay in the exchange, but it costs you.
		<<tiredness 6>><<ggtiredness>>
	<<else>>
		Riley reads it and punishes you for it. The hit snaps through you. Nobody here is softening this.
		<<pain 12>><<ggpain>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>

:: MMA Riley Challenge Start
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "mma_gym">><<effects>>
<<if $mmaRileyChallengeMode isnot "spar">><<set $mmaRileyChallengeMode to "unlock">><</if>>
<<set $mmaRileyScore to 0>><<set $mmaRileyWaveScore to 0>><<set $mmaRileyLastScore to 0>><<set $mmaRileyLastAction to 0>>
<<if $leftarm is "bound" or $rightarm is "bound">>
	Riley's eyes drop to your hands and <<his>> expression hardens. "No. We are not doing this with your hands tied up."
	<br><br>
	<<if $mmaRileyChallengeMode is "spar">>
		"You want to spar, you use your hands properly," <<he>> says, already stepping in.
	<<else>>
		"You want me to assess your movement, I need to see all of it," <<he>> says, already stepping in.
	<</if>>
	<<He>> strips the binding away and jerks <<his>> chin toward the mat. "There. Try again."
	<br><br><<unbind>>
	<<link [[Next|MMA Riley Challenge Start]]>><</link>>
<<else>>

<<if $mmaRileyChallengeMode is "unlock">>
	Riley steps through the ropes and jerks <<his>> chin for you to follow.
	"Five reads. Two waves. Show me you can think, move, and keep your nerve when somebody better than you is trying to make you stupid."
	<br><br>
	The people near the ring go quiet. They want a show.
	<br><br>
	<<if $mmaWeightsSessions gte 3>>
		Your body still remembers the weights room. The bar, the sled, the burning repetition of it. At least you are not stepping in cold.
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	Riley rolls one shoulder and motions you in. "Again. Five reads. I want to see whether you learned something or just got lucky last time."
	<br><br>
	There is less laughter this time. More watching.
	<br><br>
<</if>>
Riley circles first, relaxed, waiting to see how you choose to open.
<br><br>
<<switch random(1,6)>>
	<<case 1>>
		<<link [[Stay patient and keep your guard high|MMA Riley Challenge 2]]>><<set $mmaRileyLastAction to "You hold your guard high and refuse to chase the first opening Riley offers.">><<set $mmaRileyLastScore to 3>><<set $mmaRileyScore += 3>><<set $mmaRileyWaveScore += 3>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Step in hard and try to bully space from Riley|MMA Riley Challenge 2]]>><<set $mmaRileyLastAction to "You step in hard, trying to bully some space out of Riley before Riley can settle.">><<set $mmaRileyLastScore to -3>><<set $mmaRileyScore -= 3>><<set $mmaRileyWaveScore -= 3>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Circle and probe with your feet first|MMA Riley Challenge 2]]>><<set $mmaRileyLastAction to "You circle first and watch Riley's feet, probing for something cleaner than a blind entry.">><<set $mmaRileyLastScore to 1>><<set $mmaRileyScore += 1>><<set $mmaRileyWaveScore += 1>><</link>>
	<<case 2>>
		<<link [[Stay patient and keep your guard high|MMA Riley Challenge 2]]>><<set $mmaRileyLastAction to "You hold your guard high and refuse to chase the first opening Riley offers.">><<set $mmaRileyLastScore to 3>><<set $mmaRileyScore += 3>><<set $mmaRileyWaveScore += 3>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Circle and probe with your feet first|MMA Riley Challenge 2]]>><<set $mmaRileyLastAction to "You circle first and watch Riley's feet, probing for something cleaner than a blind entry.">><<set $mmaRileyLastScore to 1>><<set $mmaRileyScore += 1>><<set $mmaRileyWaveScore += 1>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Step in hard and try to bully space from Riley|MMA Riley Challenge 2]]>><<set $mmaRileyLastAction to "You step in hard, trying to bully some space out of Riley before Riley can settle.">><<set $mmaRileyLastScore to -3>><<set $mmaRileyScore -= 3>><<set $mmaRileyWaveScore -= 3>><</link>>
	<<case 3>>
		<<link [[Step in hard and try to bully space from Riley|MMA Riley Challenge 2]]>><<set $mmaRileyLastAction to "You step in hard, trying to bully some space out of Riley before Riley can settle.">><<set $mmaRileyLastScore to -3>><<set $mmaRileyScore -= 3>><<set $mmaRileyWaveScore -= 3>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Stay patient and keep your guard high|MMA Riley Challenge 2]]>><<set $mmaRileyLastAction to "You hold your guard high and refuse to chase the first opening Riley offers.">><<set $mmaRileyLastScore to 3>><<set $mmaRileyScore += 3>><<set $mmaRileyWaveScore += 3>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Circle and probe with your feet first|MMA Riley Challenge 2]]>><<set $mmaRileyLastAction to "You circle first and watch Riley's feet, probing for something cleaner than a blind entry.">><<set $mmaRileyLastScore to 1>><<set $mmaRileyScore += 1>><<set $mmaRileyWaveScore += 1>><</link>>
	<<case 4>>
		<<link [[Step in hard and try to bully space from Riley|MMA Riley Challenge 2]]>><<set $mmaRileyLastAction to "You step in hard, trying to bully some space out of Riley before Riley can settle.">><<set $mmaRileyLastScore to -3>><<set $mmaRileyScore -= 3>><<set $mmaRileyWaveScore -= 3>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Circle and probe with your feet first|MMA Riley Challenge 2]]>><<set $mmaRileyLastAction to "You circle first and watch Riley's feet, probing for something cleaner than a blind entry.">><<set $mmaRileyLastScore to 1>><<set $mmaRileyScore += 1>><<set $mmaRileyWaveScore += 1>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Stay patient and keep your guard high|MMA Riley Challenge 2]]>><<set $mmaRileyLastAction to "You hold your guard high and refuse to chase the first opening Riley offers.">><<set $mmaRileyLastScore to 3>><<set $mmaRileyScore += 3>><<set $mmaRileyWaveScore += 3>><</link>>
	<<case 5>>
		<<link [[Circle and probe with your feet first|MMA Riley Challenge 2]]>><<set $mmaRileyLastAction to "You circle first and watch Riley's feet, probing for something cleaner than a blind entry.">><<set $mmaRileyLastScore to 1>><<set $mmaRileyScore += 1>><<set $mmaRileyWaveScore += 1>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Stay patient and keep your guard high|MMA Riley Challenge 2]]>><<set $mmaRileyLastAction to "You hold your guard high and refuse to chase the first opening Riley offers.">><<set $mmaRileyLastScore to 3>><<set $mmaRileyScore += 3>><<set $mmaRileyWaveScore += 3>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Step in hard and try to bully space from Riley|MMA Riley Challenge 2]]>><<set $mmaRileyLastAction to "You step in hard, trying to bully some space out of Riley before Riley can settle.">><<set $mmaRileyLastScore to -3>><<set $mmaRileyScore -= 3>><<set $mmaRileyWaveScore -= 3>><</link>>
	<<case 6>>
		<<link [[Circle and probe with your feet first|MMA Riley Challenge 2]]>><<set $mmaRileyLastAction to "You circle first and watch Riley's feet, probing for something cleaner than a blind entry.">><<set $mmaRileyLastScore to 1>><<set $mmaRileyScore += 1>><<set $mmaRileyWaveScore += 1>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Step in hard and try to bully space from Riley|MMA Riley Challenge 2]]>><<set $mmaRileyLastAction to "You step in hard, trying to bully some space out of Riley before Riley can settle.">><<set $mmaRileyLastScore to -3>><<set $mmaRileyScore -= 3>><<set $mmaRileyWaveScore -= 3>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Stay patient and keep your guard high|MMA Riley Challenge 2]]>><<set $mmaRileyLastAction to "You hold your guard high and refuse to chase the first opening Riley offers.">><<set $mmaRileyLastScore to 3>><<set $mmaRileyScore += 3>><<set $mmaRileyWaveScore += 3>><</link>>
<</switch>>
<</if>>

:: MMA Riley Challenge 2
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "mma_gym">><<effects>>
<<include "MMA Riley Challenge Choice Result">>
Riley clips your guard and crowds in, trying to turn the pace ugly before you can settle.
<br><br>
How do you deal with the pressure?
<br><br>
<<switch random(1,6)>>
	<<case 1>>
		<<link [[Reset your feet and make Riley come to you again|MMA Riley Challenge 3]]>><<set $mmaRileyLastAction to "You reset your feet instead of panicking, forcing Riley to come find you again on your terms.">><<set $mmaRileyLastScore to 3>><<set $mmaRileyScore += 3>><<set $mmaRileyWaveScore += 3>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Throw back immediately and try to win the exchange now|MMA Riley Challenge 3]]>><<set $mmaRileyLastAction to "You fire back immediately, more irritated than balanced, trying to win the exchange before it finishes forming.">><<set $mmaRileyLastScore to -3>><<set $mmaRileyScore -= 3>><<set $mmaRileyWaveScore -= 3>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Fight for position and lean into Riley's pressure|MMA Riley Challenge 3]]>><<set $mmaRileyLastAction to "You meet the pressure and fight Riley for position instead of giving ground for free.">><<set $mmaRileyLastScore to 1>><<set $mmaRileyScore += 1>><<set $mmaRileyWaveScore += 1>><</link>>
	<<case 2>>
		<<link [[Reset your feet and make Riley come to you again|MMA Riley Challenge 3]]>><<set $mmaRileyLastAction to "You reset your feet instead of panicking, forcing Riley to come find you again on your terms.">><<set $mmaRileyLastScore to 3>><<set $mmaRileyScore += 3>><<set $mmaRileyWaveScore += 3>><</link>>
		<br>
