:: MMA Riley Challenge Intermission
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "mma_gym">><<effects>>
<<include "MMA Riley Challenge Choice Result">>
<<if $mmaRileyWaveScore gte 5>>
	Riley steps back. The look on <<his>> face is sharp, but something's shifted.
	"You are progressing. Don't ruin it by getting excited."
<<elseif $mmaRileyWaveScore gte 0>>
	Riley says nothing. Just looks at you.
	<br><br>
	"Again," <<he>> says at last.
<<else>>
	One of the gym-goers laughs. Another joins in. Riley doesn't shut them up. <<He>> just looks at you.
	<br><br>
	"Again," <<he>> says.
<</if>>
<br><br>
The second wave starts rougher. Riley doesn't ease you in this time.
<br><br>
How do you answer the next engagement?
<br><br>
<<switch random(1,6)>>
