:: MMA Gym Molestation Ejaculation
<<effects>><<ejaculation>>
<<if $enemyanger gte ($enemyangermax / 5) * 3>>
	<<He>> steps back first, still glaring as if you are the one who made trouble. You tense when <<he>> leans close again, but <<he>> only wipes <<his>> mouth with the back of <<his>> hand.
	<br><br>
	"Keep your mouth shut, <<bitch>>." Before leaving, <<he>> spits near your feet. You flinch.
	<<wash>><<faceejacstat>><<ejacstat>><<set $facegoo += 1>>
<<elseif $enemyanger gte 1>>
	<<He>> backs off with a sharp breath, annoyed. <<He>> glances toward the door, listening for any movement beyond it.
	<br><br>
	"Don't make this my problem," <<he>> says. Then <<he>> slips past the lockers and leaves you there, the door swinging shut behind <<him>>.
<<else>>
	<<He>> stays close for a moment, watching you gather yourself on the wet tile. <<He>> doesn't look like someone who did anything wrong.
	<br><br>
	<<He>> gives you a thin smile. "Gym stays in the gym, yeah?"
	<br><br>
	Then <<he>> steps away, leaving you with the running water and nothing else.
<</if>>
<<endcombat>>
<<tearful>> you force yourself upright. <<clotheson>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|MMA Gym Changing Room]]>><</link>>

:: MMA Gym Molestation Escape
<<effects>>
<<He>> yells out and hits the tile hard. <span class="green"><<tearful>> you use the chance to get out of the shower</span>, stumbling between the lockers before <<he>> can grab you again.
<br><br>
<<endcombat>>
<<npc Riley>><<person1>><<npcincr Riley love 1>>
Riley can tell something's wrong the moment <<he>> sees you. <<His>> jaw tightens, but <<he>> keeps <<his>> distance. 
<<if $worn.upper.name is "naked" and $worn.lower.name is "naked">>
	<<He>> just takes a clean towel from nearby and offers it to you, letting you get covered before anyone looks over.
	<br><br>
	<<clothesontowel>>
	You take it and wrap it around yourself.
<<else>>
	<<clotheson>>
<</if>>
Riley waits, then asks for a name.
<br><br>
You shake your head. You just want out of this room.
<br><br>
Riley does not press. <<He>> only turns towards the regulars and murmurs something you can't hear. The changing room stays quieter after that.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|MMA Gym Changing Room]]>><</link>>

:: MMA Gym Outside Exhibitionism
<<effects>><<endevent>>
<<flaunting>> You push through the gym door and step out onto Nightingale Street without bothering to change first.
<br><br>
The air hits you first. Then the street notices. A<<generate1>><<person1>> walking <<his>> dog shifts <<his>> gaze over to you and holds it a beat too long before looking away. Two guys by the kebab shop across the road nudge each other. Nobody says anything. They just... notice.
<<exhibitionism3>>
<br><br>
The MMA gym's door swings shut behind you.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Nightingale Street]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MMA Regular Sparring
<<endevent>><<generate1>><<person1>><<effects>><<pass 45>><<set _sparRoll to random(1, 4)>><<speechresolve>>
Riley pairs you with a <<person>> after a warm-up. "Light work," Riley says, which in this room seems to mean nobody is supposed to admit how hard they are trying.
<br><br>
<<if _sparRoll is 1>>
	Your partner starts using the breaks wrong. <<His>> hands find your waist during the reset. Your side. Your hip. Then grope your groin.
	<br><br>
	<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
		You keep your guard up, pretending not to notice until Riley calls time. The regular smirks as <<he>> backs away.
		<<arousal 300>><<stress 2>><<athletics 1>><<garousal>><<gstress>><<gathletics>>
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		You let the reset happen, shoulders tight and mouth shut, because making trouble here feels worse than enduring it. Riley's whistle finally cuts the round apart.
		<<arousal 300>><<stress 3>><<athletics 1>><<garousal>><<gstress>><<gathletics>>
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		You catch <<his>> wrist the next time it wanders. "Hands where they're meant to be."
		<br><br>
		The words come out controlled enough to make the nearest regulars look away. Riley notices, and the rest of the round stays almost respectable.
		<<athletics 1>><<stress 2>><<gathletics>><<gstress>>
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		You stop giving <<him>> clean resets. Every move costs <<him>> something, and after the second one <<he>> starts remembering where <<his>> hands belong.
		<<athletics 1>><<tiredness 8>><<gathletics>><<gtiredness>>
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		You shove <<him>> off the next time <<he>> drifts in. "Try training instead of pawing. You might learn something."
		<br><br>
		A few people snort. Your partner's smile drops, and the rest of the round turns rough enough that Riley has to bark at both of you.
		<<athletics 1>><<pain 2>><<stress 3>><<gathletics>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<<else>>
		You stop giving <<him>> clean resets. Every clinch costs <<him>> something.
		<<athletics 1>><<tiredness 8>><<gathletics>><<gtiredness>>
	<</if>>
<<elseif _sparRoll is 2>>
	Riley stops the round to correct your stance, steps in, moves your guard by hand, nudges your elbow into place.
	<br><br>
	<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
		"I want to get it right," you say, quieter than you meant to.
		<br><br>
		"Then stop apologising with your shoulders," Riley says. "You are allowed to take space. Start acting like it."
		<<willpower 1>><<gwillpower>><<stress 4>><<gstress>>
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"Show me again," you say, holding still as Riley moves your guard.
		<br><br>
		Riley's mouth tightens. "Don't go limp. Help me fix it, or you'll just need fixing twice."
		<<willpower 1>><<gwillpower>><<stress 3>><<gstress>>
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		"Again, please," you say, trying to make the request sound steadier than your breath.
		<br><br>
		Riley gives you another correction, brisk and exact. "There. Polite is fine. Useful is better."
		<<physique 1>><<gphysique>><<tiredness 5>><<gtiredness>>
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		"Should I start making you look bad?"
		<br><br>
		Riley laughs. "Please do. It would be a nice change from correcting you."
		<br><br>
		Riley doesn't give you time to enjoy it.
		<<athletics 1>><<pain 3>><<gathletics>><<gpain>>
	<<else>>
		You nod, reset your feet, and repeat the movement until Riley no longer has to touch your elbow back into place.
		<br><br>
		"Better," Riley says. "Do it before you need saving next time."
		<<athletics 1>><<tiredness 6>><<gtiredness>><<gathletics>>
	<</if>>
<<elseif _sparRoll is 3>>
	The round turns scrappy when your partner tries to rush every exchange. It is ugly work, full of elbows tucked too late and feet fighting for space on the mat.
	<br><br>
	<<if currentSkillValue('athletics') gte 700 or currentSkillValue('physique') gte 5000>>
		You keep calm under the rush, step out of <<his>> path, and let <<him>> chase you into bad positions until Riley finally calls time.
		<br><br>
		"Not bad," Riley says.
		<<athletics 2>><<physique 1>><<tiredness 8>><<gathletics>><<gphysique>><<gtiredness>>
	<<else>>
		You make it through, though it is a mess. <<He>> keeps rushing you back while Riley shouts at you to move.
		<<athletics 1>><<pain 3>><<tiredness 8>><<stress 3>><<gathletics>><<gpain>><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	The spar stays clean for once. You throw strikes and reset until the round starts feeling like actual training.
	<<athletics 1>><<physique 1>><<willpower 1>><<tiredness 6>><<gathletics>><<gphysique>><<gwillpower>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
Riley claps once. "Done. Water, then out of the way."
<br><br>
